Common Questions
How do I restore my purchases?
Open the Store in the App and tap Restore Purchase. Purchases are tied to the Apple ID, Google account, or Steam account you bought them with, and to the App's anonymous account on that device.

How do I move my characters to another device?
In Settings, open Your Characters and choose Transfer to Another Device. You will get a one-time code that works for 24 hours. Enter it on the other device to bring your characters across. Transfers move from iPhone or iPad to Android or Steam.

How do I manage or cancel the Votary's Tithe subscription?
On iPhone or iPad: Settings > your name > Subscriptions. On Android: Google Play Store > Payments & subscriptions > Subscriptions, or the Manage Subscription button on the Tithe screen in the App.

Can I turn off ads?
Valemark shows only optional rewarded ads. An ad plays only when you press a button that offers a reward, so you can simply skip them. The Steam version has no ads.

The game is crashing or not loading.
Close the App completely and reopen it. Make sure you are running the latest version, and restart your device if the problem continues. You can send a bug report from Settings in the App.

